# RC-007 — Craftsmanship Pass

North star: **"This application is exceptionally well made."**

## Before polishing ask

- Does this use `CraftsmanshipRhythm` / `AppDuration` / `AppSpacing` — not magic numbers?
- Does body text share one line-height (1.76) across reading and chat?
- Do section labels use engraved tracking (2.2)?
- Does motion use `OraclySignatureMotion` press/release?
- Is the change almost invisible — felt, not seen?

If any answer is no — revise.

## Canonical doc

`docs/RC-007.md`

## Out of scope

New features · redesign · more visual effects

## Success

Premium feel users cannot explain — only feel.
